        "**Associative learning** links a sensory cue with an outcome. Goforth and colleagues conditioned captive juvenile loggerheads for 2 months using two replicated geographical fields. Both fields received equal time, but food was delivered in one assigned magnetic signature. Training kept the same pairing for the full 2-month period. Each animal received food in one field only.",
