        "A learned signature can work as a compound cue rather than a single coordinate. This approach identifies which magnetic parameters drive discrimination without assuming a complete geographical map. Each mismatched field changes one component while keeping the other fixed, which tests each component separately. Mismatch tests therefore keep one learned value present at a time.",
